VERDICT
======================================================================================================================
    FG041 PASSES for FG001: the six TDGs are Newtonian from their baryons (chi^2 1.09 for 6, <M_dyn/M_bar> = 1.16 +- 0.26).  The framework's own law applied to each TDG -- the reading FG001 replaces -- is disfavoured by d chi^2 >= 5.2 even at the most favourable host mass; with a 10% equilibrium systematic the gap stays >= 4.8.  Caveat (the authors'): the discs have turned < 1 orbit.

